Third-party material
--------------------

No third-party code or text is copied into this repository. The catalogue's facts (limits,
prices, dates) come from the providers' own pages and from public listings, and each
provider's provider.yaml names its sources. Several open-source projects shaped the ideas
here; they are credited in the README, as thanks and not as a legal notice.

Code taken from another work goes here, one entry per work: its name, its licence, its URL
and the files it is in. An MPL-2.0 file also keeps its own header. See "Code and licences"
in docs/adding-a-provider.md.
